nimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663092015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123420#issuecomment-5663092015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123420","id":5663092015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUYvtLw","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T11:16:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T11:16:50Z","body":"After getting a bit familiar with the engine, I finally found the root of the issue.\nI'm now fairly sure that it comes from Viewport::_push_unhandled_input_internal in scene/main/viewport/viewport.cpp\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L3651\n\nIt's a deliberate choice, which to be honest, makes a lot of sense.\nSeems like the most logical way of doing this.\nFixing this would require *a minima* a special flag which would require a special way of setting the mouse_mode.\nAnd there might be other [issues](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119205) that I'm not foreseeing, that might require more flags.\n\nI think that deferring the set of mouse_mode should still be the solution to this issue.\nHowever, deferring is not consistent, which is a problem.\nI explored the code to deferring too, but I haven't understand it well enough.\n\nMaybe there is another mechanism that I don' t know about to do something like that ?\nI'm very inexperienced with the engine, so maybe someone will have a better solution than what I can think of !","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663092015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5675200293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123420#issuecomment-5675200293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123420","id":5675200293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUkSvJQ","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T05:24:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T05:48:07Z","body":"Another solution might be for to use a boolean and defer \"manually\" to the physics tic.\nThis seems to give consistant behavior, although I'm not sure how the framework loop works so I'm not sure it's a good enough solution.\nIt'd also become a documentation issue again.\n(defering to _process would give similar result to call_defer, since they work on idle frames, which are not predictible if I understand correctly)\n\n```\nvar should_capture_mouse: bool = false\n\nfunc _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\t\n\tif event is InputEventMouseButton && event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT && event.pressed:\n\t\tshould_capture_mouse = true\n\nfunc _physics_process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tif should_capture_mouse:\n\t\tshould_capture_mouse = false\n\t\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5675200293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5904982644","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123420#issuecomment-5904982644","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123420","id":5904982644,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABX_bidA","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","